Spec: Bounded active authorization supervisor

Purpose:
  Close active Agent sessions when their signed authority expires, changes or loses authenticated control health.

Owns:
  ./LeaseSupervisor.cs

References:
  ./ControlClient.sdd
  ./ServerLease.sdd

Must:
  Register at most one hundred twenty-eight active receipts, bound to the same control identity, clock and epoch.
  Poll authenticated current authority in batches of at most sixty-four every five hundred milliseconds; reject expired local receipts before a network call.
  Cancel affected guards on known revocation, control failure, epoch mismatch or disposal within the three-second RPC bound plus poll scheduling.
  Never revive a stopped guard or replace a live stream's authority generations; renew only newer valid leases for unchanged current authority.
  Keep tokens inside Agent components and make guard lifetime observable without business data injection.
